= Instructions

Fill a #Cocktail shaker{} with @Ice{}. Add the @Cold espresso{1 1/2 oz}, @Dhos vodka{1 oz}, 
and @Noa coffee liqueur{1/2 oz}. Shake well until chilled.

Strain into a #Martini glass{}, filling it about two-thirds of the way.

Slowly pour the @Guinness{2 oz} over the back of a spoon to create a layered effect.

Sprinkle with @Chocolate shavings{} or add a few @Coffee beans{} on top.